  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved governance of labour migration and protection of migrant workers in line with ILS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kuwait has a population of 4.5 million people, of whom around 70 per cent are migrant workers. According to the statistics authority, the number of domestic workers in the country in 2023 was around one fifth of the labour market.The ILO is the UN specialized agency with the mandate to promote social justice, decent work and human and labour rights, including in particular the ILO&#x2019;s Fundamental Principles and Rights at Work. 
ILO will support constituents on strengthening labour migration governance with improved access to protection services and decent work opportunities.The ILO will support constituents to promote the rights of all workers, including migrant worker.</narrative>
  </description>
